{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 161696, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 108108, "uid": 55158, "type": 4, "title": "梅西耶水WB正式攻略", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1657268758, "updated_at": 1657421813, "updated_uid": 55158, "comment_at": 1657560785, "last_at": 1657560785, "comment_count": 47, "status": 1, "summary": "萌新可以看下这篇。建议看下这篇、这篇、这篇、这篇。一、阵容速览本期策划整了个大活，直接把日服boss搬来国际服，导致防御力从2400左右直接升到4000左右（日服wb防御力为4000左右），而且没有对", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1604847853794_13755678.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,w_1600", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 13, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 16192, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 5, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 161696, "content": "<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;background:transparent;\">萌新可以看下<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/22411.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;color:blue;\">这篇</a></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;background:transparent;\">。</span><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">建议看下<a href=\"https://dc.gamekee.com/86150.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">这篇</a>、<a href=\"https://dc.gamekee.com/73498.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">这篇</a>、<a href=\"https://dc.gamekee.com/57416.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">这篇</a>、<a href=\"https://dc.gamekee.com/48889.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">这篇</a>。</span></div><div style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title4\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(0, 182, 79); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">一、阵容速览</span></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"background: transparent; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background: transparent;\"><span style=\"background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">本期策划整了个大活，</span>直接把日服boss搬来国际服，导致防御力从2400左右直接升到4000左右（日服wb防御力为4000左右），而且没有对boss的减速抗性进行处理。具体下面会讲。<span style=\"font-style: italic;\">还好没有提前写攻略捏，经典背刺，这次是国际服第一次4000防boss，以后估计都是4000了吧，U木伞地位直线上升。</span></span></div></span><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><br></div></span><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background: transparent; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">若想达成时停，建议使用充能量降低（狗哥、光击剑、冻结、水蛇）而非充能速度降低的天子。</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">充能量降低、</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;\">水蛇、冻结由于图标不同，可叠加。<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">U火莫娜描述为充能量降低，实为充能速度降低，经典翻译错误。羊妹的时间篡改虽然是充能速度降低，但实战也很不错，可能是羊妹复合个退Skill条吧，原因不明。</span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;\">经过实测，</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">+6光击剑和比利（标准队伍前排左4）的组合即可达成完全时停</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">，+6狗哥和比利的组合若饰品3号位附魔达到一定程度也可达成时停。</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;\">+6狗哥和比利充能量降低幅度之和仅仅为92.1%，木猫的充能速度降低幅度（60.4%）高于狗哥的充能量降低幅度（52.1%），</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">但</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">木猫与比利组合却无法达成时停</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">！</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;\">我们知道，boss的战场buff是自带+20%的充能速度，而仅仅是转圈的话，充能速度与充能量是直接加算的，这就非常疑惑了，加起来才-72.1%怎么就时停了呢（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">也有可能是我的天子饰品3号位附魔有很多攻击时减少skill量表的附魔）</span>。原因是照搬了日服的boss，而日服的boss在这方面没有做处理。下面的内容更加佐证这一观点。</span></div></span><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">国际服在很久之前的西瓦火WB中，排行榜是这个阵容。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1604847853794_13755678.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,w_1600\" style=\"\" data-width=\"1034\" data-height=\"714\"></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\">请注意，当时就有+6狗哥和比利的组合，而不少玩家都掏的出这个配置，然而并没有任何关于时停的内容传出！由此可见，国际服对boss的减速抗性做了一定处理。<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">另外，我怀疑对于退Skill条（光击剑、羊妹），日服也没有进行处理。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"background: transparent;\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\"></div></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background: transparent; font-size: 14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 20px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">言归正传，我比较建议狗哥/光击剑+比利/高加羊妹的组合，光击剑优于狗哥，羊妹最好点火不然概率太低了。</span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">如果没有光击剑只有狗哥，附魔又不够强，或者是光击剑加值不够，导致定了但是没完全定住，建议上个奶妈</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">。</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;\">比利对加值没有要求，命中率和减速幅度均与加值无关，+0即可用，水蛇的减速幅度为40%也高于冻结的20%。</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">实测+6狗哥也可达成时停（但需要天子饰品3号位附魔有很多攻击时减少skill量表的附魔）。对于掏不出狗哥/光击剑+比利/高加羊妹组合的玩家，移步天子推荐。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background:transparent;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"background:transparent;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\">标准</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\">队伍：</span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594189900654_19062620.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594189900654_19062620.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"16\" style=\"width:69px;height:69px;font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618084434_40474750.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618084434_40474750.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"17\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;width:69px;height:69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/57/2022/2/30/553788.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 20px; width: 69px; height: 69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1595404228745_73089316.jpg?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"109\" data-height=\"115\" style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 69px; height: 69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www