); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618896624_15651227.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618896624_15651227.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"6\" style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 69px; height: 69px;\"></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640167039347_80114058.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640167039347_80114058.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"12\" style=\"width:69px;height:69px;font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1616566415025_2485085.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1616566415025_2485085.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"13\" style=\"width:69px;height:69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617553253_51918940.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617553253_51918940.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"14\" style=\"width:69px;height:69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1605171421247_66160140.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1605171421247_66160140.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"15\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;width:69px;height:69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1619237872353_26621634.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1619237872353_26621634.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"19\" style=\"width:69px;height:69px;font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640167030917_54886732.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640167030917_54886732.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"20\" style=\"width:69px;height:69px;font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1622617495455_1966492.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1622617495455_1966492.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"7\" style=\"width:69px;height:69px;font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618127976_61907047.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618127976_61907047.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"5\" style=\"font-size:16px;width:69px;height:69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1612855166919_44189771.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1612855166919_44189771.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"21\" style=\"width:69px;height:69px;font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/15803/2022/2/31/955877.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;width:69px;height:69px;\"></div></span></div></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 20px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div></div></span><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">技能预约：</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">火人鱼、白仆猫：</span>STTTT；</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">鲁邦：STTTT；</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">铃铛：TS或者S；</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">其余：S。</span><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">洛基可以不设技能预约，这样他行动的优先级就会是最低的。</span></div></span><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;font-size:14px;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">DS顺序：</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><div style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\">蜡烛——任意——对策</div></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"></div><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;font-size:14px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"></div><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\">队长技：</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">若饰品2号位S级减益命中附魔+“捣蛋鬼莫娜”魂卡合计数量能够使妨碍人手一个时（通常为6或7），可设定洛基（后排右1）为队长，且吕布可换为3红/U鲜花；<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">对于达不到上述要求的玩家，这个阵容没有任何奶，一旦狗哥/光击剑和比利的减速打不中就寄，若是求稳建议用木人鱼队长，且此时洛基可以不带</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">。</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"></div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">魂卡：</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">妨碍首选“捣蛋鬼莫娜”；</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">前排辅助首选“表演的时刻到了”或“花之乐园”；</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">前排没有合适魂卡就白板血防或者带血量的魂卡；</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">木刀首选“格外小心”次选“玫瑰花下”，没有就白板攻暴魂卡。</span></span></div></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title4\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">二、天子推荐</span></span></div></div><br style=\"\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"></div><div class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\">1.非攻击型天子</span></div></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">参考<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/73498.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:blue;font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">此贴</a>。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">需要注意的是：</span></div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">①墨丘利若不点4红，只能用下位的木基佬。</span></div><div style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">②木伞强烈建议6红，后面星云一开，wb伤害直接关系到人偶的获得，早点早享受。</span></div><div style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">③糖猫强烈建议3红。</span></div><div style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">④洛基、比利对于加值没有要求。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">对于狗哥/光击剑有其一，但没有比利的玩家，问题不大，比利可以用高加羊妹、高加姬瓦、高加水妮可代替。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">对于没有狗哥和光击剑的玩家，问题比较大，建议用暗妲比+复活奶的老一套苟命方法，水炮妹、奈芙缇丝也都是写在常用天子里的全体盾。比利如果有可以带一个，黑仆猫作为忍耐对策也还不错，由于ds还是挺疼的，如果想让boss放不出ds，没有狗哥只能带老板娘，队伍格子会较紧。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></div></span></span></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><div class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(0,182,79);background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\">2.攻击型天子</span></div></div></div><span style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">参考<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/57416.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">此贴</a>。铃铛伤害一骑绝尘，剩下的参考帖子有啥用啥。非冲榜玩家不建议四刀流，攻击力调整涉及到点火核心、魂卡等比较复杂。</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><br style=\"\"></div></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(0,176,240);\"></span></div></span></span></div><div style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"background:transparent;\"><span style=\"background:transparent;\"><div style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(0,176,240);\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title4\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;background:transparent;\">二、前后排站位＆属性调整</span></div></div><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background:rgb(255,255,255);\">前后排站位和攻击力调整之间关系复杂。先确定前后排站位，再调整攻击力。<span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;\">一切站位的最大前提是保证生存，以生存为最优先考虑。</span></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">木系天子攻击力顺序前五，三把木刀+木人鱼+木伞，对于没有U蜡烛的玩家，内鬼糖猫随机加攻，除非把木人鱼和木伞攻击力堆到很高，否则做不到稳定给木人鱼木伞时间扭曲的。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">对于部分天子会有特殊的站位要求，为了读懂接下来的内容需要了解两件事。一是FT后会甩一轮技能，其顺序有点讲究。二是多名天子技能同时转好下，技能释放的先后遵循三条规则：①设置技能预约的＞没设置的；②前排＞后排；③站左边＞右边，规则冲突时优先级按①＞②＞③决定。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">1.若带了鲸鱼，则鲸鱼站前排，并在其他所有妨碍的左边。鲸鱼的SS含减益爆发，为了在FT后一轮技能中，不爆掉关键debuff，建议放在所有妨碍的前面。<br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">2.木人鱼通常站鲸鱼后面。同样考虑到FT后一轮技能，为了保证后续所有减益的命中率，建议将木人鱼放在鲸鱼以外的全部妨碍天子的前面，也就是前排左二的位置。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">3.刀放在后排最左边。这是考虑到多名天子同时转好技能时，尽早的出手。</span></div>&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">同时上了3红白仆猫和火人鱼的情况下，两者需隔开一定位置，比如白仆猫站左4，火人鱼站左7，这是为了在甩完一轮ft后，岔开两者的瞬补。</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><div style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">如果生存不能保证，原则如下。</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">①六星站前排，点火红防天子站前排。<br style=\"\">②未点火的火天子站后排。</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br></div></span></div><div style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"background:transparent;\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title4\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;background:transparent;\">三、点火推荐及附魔</span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px;background:transparent;\"></span></div></div><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">点火顺序推荐：<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">U铃铛=3红糖猫=U木伞＞3红光月月=4红墨丘利＞3红白仆猫（这期用不到）</span>＞3红木人鱼＞</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">5红鲁邦＞</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">U</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">木莫娜。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px; background: transparent;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">除开最重要的饰品2号位附魔，第二重要的附魔是刀的武器、防具、饰品的1号位附魔，顶配附魔提供1000+600+1000=2600绿攻，老玩家追求达到2000。其余附魔随便用用，保证生存即可。</span><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; background: transparent;\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">\n\n</div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">为了配合减速，进一步压榨boss的行动空间，饰品3号位附魔：B级附魔，使用SS攻击时，30%概率减少4-6%Skill量表：S级附魔，攻击时30%概率减少10%-15%Skill量表。前者由于限定SS攻击，可以给一众妨碍用，后者优先给六连刀，会触发6次判定。<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">考虑到</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">现在没有三倍附魔，而且这是锦上添花，不是雪中送炭，我不建议去刷。</span></span></div></div><br></div></div></span></span></span></span></span></div></span></span></div></span></div></span></span></div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1604847853794_13755678.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,w_1600"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 55158, "username": "Kyun", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/12.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 194, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 99017156, "content_num": 1065, "read_num":